From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pulsar Seat <pulsar-seat@invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 08:08:29 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] pulsar: pulsar_pad gamepad backend

gamepad = pulsar_ds4 | pulsar_ds5 | pulsar_ds5e | pulsar_xone (and auto without ViGEmBus on a Pulsar seat): pad.wanted / pad.released events, pad.attach / pad.denied / pad.detach requests, USB-layout input reports into the per-pad shared channel (protocol 1 seqlock) and rumble, trigger rumble, adaptive triggers and lightbar from the output ring back to the client. SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
